DTSTAMP:20261004T151650Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261004
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261005
SUMMARY:Boos\, Brews\, & Candles
DESCRIPTION:Raw Blossom is joining us over at Sandbox for a seasonal candle making experience! Autumn weather\, candles\, and a delicious beverage makes for ultimate cozy vibes. Included in your $54 ticket is everything you’ll need to make your very own\, unique candle. Blend your own seasonal fragrance\, and decorate your candle with ghost toppers! Once your candle has set\, take it home and enjoy your handmade creation. Your ticket also includes a drink token good for any beer\, seltzer\, NA\, or soft drink. No candle making experience necessary. Limited seats\, so reserve your spot now!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/boos-brews-%26-candles/26045/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventesotericcollage26180-20261004@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261004T151650Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261004
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261005
SUMMARY:Esoteric Collage
DESCRIPTION:A look at the history of collage and an opportunity to make collages and learn collage techniques with Montreal artist James Gardner. In this Sunday afternoon workshop\, learn about alternative histories of collage\, proto-collage not usually discussed by art historians\, as well as the ways in which collage continues to permeate popular culture. Tuition includes all supplies. Optional materials to bring to class: any 2-dimensional items\, photographs\, etc. that you may wish to collage.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/esoteric-collage/26180/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventfallthemedcookiedecorating26033-20261004@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261004T151650Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261004
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261005
SUMMARY:Fall-Themed Cookie Decorating
DESCRIPTION:In this DECORATING ONLY class\, The Learning Kitchen at Chocolates and Tomatoes Farm partners up with Chef Missy of the Preppy Chef to offer this special class. Chef Missy will Describe what makes a good cut out cookie and types of royal icing Give a cookie decorating introduction Demonstrate each piping and artistry technique (pipe outline/dam\, fill/flood\, wet on wet\, wet on dry\, scribing) Discuss how to achieve a beautiful smooth finish Participants will Get a taster/inspiration cookie Practice the techniques the chef is demonstrating Take home the 12 cookies you decorated\, recipes\, and links to tips to do it again. No piping or decorating experience necessary. Classes are designed for adults. Teens and tweens may attend with a supportive\, registered adult. NOTE: THIS IS A DECORATING ONLY CLASS. Pictures are similar to\, but may not exactly represent cookie shapes and decorations. The Learning Kitchen at Chocolates and Tomatoes Farm has partnered with Chef Missy of The Preppy Chef to offer this class. Chef Missy has 6 years of experience using royal icing to make artistic cookies for client events and 8+ years of experience teaching others how to find their inner pastry artist.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/fall-themed-cookie-decorating/26033/
END:VEVENT
