SUMMARY:Family Day: Barns and Farms of Frederick
DESCRIPTION:Two juried exhibitions celebrating barns\, farms\, and the beauty of rural life. Barnstormers is a plein air exhibit\, paired with an Atmospheric Fired Ceramics exhibit. Presented in partnership with the Frederick County Landmarks Foundation. Family Day & Children's Activities will be held on October 4\, 2026. There will be farm life demonstrations\, children's art activities\, and food trucks.
