SUMMARY:Sip & Paint: Halloween Door Mat Edition
DESCRIPTION:Give your doorstep a spooky makeover just in time for Halloween! Join us at True Standard Distilling for a festive evening of cocktails\, creativity\, and Halloween fun. You’ll paint your own Halloween-inspired doormat with all the supplies provided. Whether your style is cute and spooky\, classic Halloween\, or a little wicked\, you’ll leave with a one-of-a-kind doormat ready to welcome trick-or-treaters—or warn visitors to enter if they dare! Sip on a handcrafted cocktail\, enjoy light snacks\, and let your creativity take over. No painting experience is needed—we’ll provide everything you need and guide you through the process. Your ticket includes: One handcrafted cocktail One doormat to paint and take home All painting supplies Light snacks
