SUMMARY:Moon Festival Alice
DESCRIPTION:MET's FUN COMPANY PRESENTS: Moon Festival Alice - A MET Original A curious child falls down a rabbit hole during a Mid-Autumn Festival celebration and enters a magical world inspired by Asian folklore\, festivals\, and modern Asian American life. Presented in partnership with The Asian American Center of Frederick. RUN TIME: Around an hour with no intermission.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/moon-festival-alice/25830/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventfrederickcitymarket11348-20261011@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261004T151650Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261011
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261012
SUMMARY:Frederick City Market
DESCRIPTION:The Frederick City Market is a local food and artisan market located in the historic district of Downtown Frederick\, Maryland. Join us on every Sunday from May through November. Parking is free on Sundays and there are usually plenty of spots on 7th Street and Market Street. You can park at Gravel and Grind (15 E 6th Street) and walk through the gap into the market lot.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/frederick-city-market/11348/
END:VEVENT
